==German==

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Beschilderungen}}

# [[signage]]

====Usage notes====
* The plural is fairly rare, but can be used for “different systems of signage”: {{m|de||Der Flughafen und der Bahnhof haben völlig unterschiedliche Beschilderungen.|t=The airport and the train station have entirely different systems of signage.}} It can also mean “signs for different purposes”: {{m|de||Auf den Packungen sind verschiedenste Beschilderungen.|There are all kinds of different signs on the packets.}}

